MONSTER
-SOLID
-COUNTKILL
+BOSSDEATH
+NOTARGET
+NOBLOOD
	States
	{
	Death:
	XDeath:
		TNT1 A 35
		TNT1 A 1 A_BossDeath
		Stop
	Spawn:
		BOSS A 0
